{
  "name": "@red-cup-engineering/codex-agent-enterprise-service",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "type": "module",
  "description": "The Codex agent's sovereign-customer enterprise: its content-addressed trajectory journal, MAPE-K actuation office and duty selection, prompt cycle, historical-demand and relevant-history selection, agential forms, and its hook, MCP, and A2A faces. Every actor, customer, office, territory, session store, object-kind namespace, and state root is read from one machine configuration record named by CODEX_ENTERPRISE_CONFIGURATION or --configuration.",
